HST Office: HST PDF, a lightweight PDF viewer with digital signing. A TypeDetection frame loader
opens PDF files in a PDFium-rendered viewer window (toolbar, thumbnails, search, copy, print, the
"Sign Document" panel with visible signature) instead of the full Draw import; "Edit in HST Draw",
hidden loads, hybrid PDFs and Tools > Options > HST Office > General > PDF Files hand over to Draw.

